    "name": "I \u2014 text-message story reenactment on tech news (transformation reveal)",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "nd_N4XYD271FCBDJ977TZ5WF5FGXD",
        "kind": "prompt",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "SHORT-FORM BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nFormat: text-message story reenactment\nTopic: tech news\nHook (first 1.5s): [one line]\nPayoff: [one line]\nOn-screen text: [exact copy or leave blank]\nRuntime: 10s, 9:16, sound-on by default."
        },
        "name": "Short-form brief"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_NQD1GMME3PDD19KTX3KT0E2ETD",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 1 \u2014 format-native hook planning. The first 1.5 seconds carry the whole retention load."
        },
        "name": "Stage 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_PHTQ0FMSH7M0ZW2N9VWX3K2JZ8",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 2 \u2014 render, finish and collect. Built for 9:16 sound-on playback."
        },
        "name": "Stage 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_3GP2VGS05GQ6H0640RW0N5VPKJ",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1400,
          "temperature": 0.84,
          "system_prompt": "You are a short-form creative director writing a text-message story reenactment about tech news for a vertical feed.\n\nRETENTION. The first 1.5 seconds must contain a visual question the viewer needs resolved. Plan an explicit beat every 2 to 3 seconds; nothing static may hold longer than that.\n\nFORMAT LAW. Honour the grammar of the text-message story reenactment \u2014 its native framing, its edit rhythm, and the specific thing audiences expect from it. If the format loops, the last frame must match the first.\n\nCAMERA. Compose 9:16 with the action in the safe centre band. Use a top-down descent onto a flat plane on a 20mm wide, framing with diagonal dynamic balance across the frame.\n\nLOOK AND SOUND. Light with a book light bounce producing an extremely soft wrap; grade as a filmic grade with halation on the specular highlights. Specify the sound design in one clause \u2014 what the viewer hears in the first second decides whether they stay.\n\nOUTPUT. Output exactly one prompt paragraph and nothing else \u2014 no labels, no lists, no explanation of your reasoning."
        },
        "name": "Format director"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_7MXEWVF7NEEPYY1XPFY7VQSGFH",
        "kind": "image-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "url": ""
        },
        "name": "Before image"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_E23R5AY742S84E7HR4K99AYN77",
        "kind": "concat",
        "position": {
          "x": 350,
          "y": 520
        },
        "config": {
          "separator": "\n\n",
          "appendable_slots": {
